# Object directory
obj/
# Dependency files (-MMD -MP). The Makefile writes them beside each object in
# obj/, but a one-off manual compile from the repo root drops `<name>.d` at the
# top level, and those showed up in `git status` as `a-q3_kernel.d`/`a-q3_vm.d`
# until v38.139. No .d file is ever a source, so the pattern is unconditional.
*.d
# Generated boot artifacts (v38.105: the QVM bytecode built from id's official
# source by id's lcc + q3asm — see scripts/build_qvm.sh)
build/
